  /// The values to filter by. Term filters accept multiple values, and a
  /// result matches if it has any of them. Range filters accept a single
  /// value. The supported values for each filterType are as follows: CATEGORY
  /// One or more category identifiers. Matches listings in those categories.
  /// CERTIFICATES One or more certification identifiers, such as ISO_27001 or
  /// SOC2_TYPE_2 . Matches listings that hold those certifications.
  /// DEPLOYED_ON_AWS The single value DEPLOYED_ON_AWS . Matches listings
  /// whose products are deployed on AWS infrastructure.
  /// FULFILLMENT_OPTION_TYPE One or more fulfillment option types, such as
  /// SAAS , AMAZON_MACHINE_IMAGE , or CONTAINER . Matches listings that you
  /// can deploy or access in those ways. MAX_AVERAGE_CUSTOMER_RATING A single
  /// rating between 0.0 and 5.0 . Matches listings whose average customer
  /// rating is at or below that value. MIN_AVERAGE_CUSTOMER_RATING A single
  /// rating between 0.0 and 5.0 . Matches listings whose average customer
  /// rating is at or above that value. NUMBER_OF_PRODUCTS SINGLE_PRODUCT or
  /// MULTI_PRODUCT . Matches single-product listings or multi-product
  /// solutions. PRICING_MODEL One or more of BYOL , CONTRACT , FREE , and
  /// USAGE . Matches listings with offers that use those pricing models.
  /// PRICING_UNIT One or more pricing units, such as USERS , HOSTS , or
  /// REQUESTS . Matches listings that bill by those units. PRODUCT_ID One or
  /// more product identifiers. Matches listings that contain those products.
  /// PUBLISHER One or more publisher identifiers. Matches listings from those
  /// sellers. SELLER_ENGAGEMENT One or more SellerEngagementType values, such
  /// as BUY_NOW or REQUEST_FOR_DEMO . Matches listings that offer those ways
  /// to engage with the seller. SPECIALIZATION One or more specialization
  /// identifiers. Matches listings that earned those specializations.
  /// SPECIALIZATION_CATEGORY One or more specialization category identifiers.
  /// Matches listings that earned a category under a specialization.
  /// TRUST_CENTER The single value HAS_TRUST_CENTER . Matches listings that
  /// have a trust center. Use SearchFacets to retrieve the values available
  /// for CATEGORY , PUBLISHER , CERTIFICATES , SPECIALIZATION , and
  /// SPECIALIZATION_CATEGORY .
  pub filter_values: List[Str]? = None
}

